WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:06.800
SCP-096 Vs SCP-835. The terrifying,&nbsp;
unstoppable killer known as the Shy Guy,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:06.800 --> 00:00:11.520
against a truly sickening abomination.&nbsp;
Which would win? Let’s find out!

00:00:11.520 --> 00:00:16.640
835 is a huge, underwater monster made from&nbsp;
human flesh, a kind of nightmarish coral&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:16.640 --> 00:00:22.320
formation with giant, grasping tentacles. It&nbsp;
drags people inside to add to its own biomass&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:22.320 --> 00:00:27.760
and releases an infectious pathogen that&nbsp;
transforms humans into terrible, violent beasts.

00:00:27.760 --> 00:00:32.800
However, we still think SCP-096 would&nbsp;
have a good chance to survive here.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:32.800 --> 00:00:36.560
Not only is it hardy and&nbsp;
relentless, it also isn’t human,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:36.560 --> 00:00:42.320
and SCP-835 appears specifically geared to&nbsp;
integrate humans into its body. As a result,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:42.320 --> 00:00:48.240
there’s a good chance that 096 would be&nbsp;
immune to the worst of SCP-096’s effects.

00:00:48.240 --> 00:00:52.560
And that might be enough for it to&nbsp;
fight back and take home the win.

